WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.390
I'm... Oda Kumiko.

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.360
You know, I can't stand men with big mouths!

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.830
Won...der...ful...

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.180
Look at me...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.950
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:56.760
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:03.130
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.720
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:26.660
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:31.330
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me - You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.630
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:38.540
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:41.140
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:45.680
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:49.080
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:12.570
Kyosuke in a Pinch.
Sweet Nothings at the Wuthering Heights.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:45.130
Oh! Kurumi! Are you using the Power again?!

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:48.770
'Cause! I'm bored!

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.070
No means no!

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.720
Indeed, it IS boring.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:14.940
We went to the tennis camp organized by our school...

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:18.960
...only to find that the courts
were monopolized by our sempais.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:26.050
On top of that,
because our sempai ordered us to...

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.670
...we were forced to watch their "demonstrations."

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:30.810
Right, let's do what he says! Let's!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.780
Yes, we shall!
Right, let's do what he says! Let's!

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:39.110
Seriously, this really was frustrating.

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:53.020
Having said that... I snuck out by myself,
and there I was!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.250
There!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:08.420
1... 2... 3... 4... 5... 6... 7!

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.650
8!

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:11.620
What?
8!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.720
That's awesome...
You made it skip eight times!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.360
No... it was seven times...

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.590
Oh? It was eight!
No... it was seven times...

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.630
No, it was seven.
Oh? It was eight!

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:31.360
Stubborn, aren't you? Still, seven or eight...
I guess it doesn't matter.

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:40.420
Oh, gosh... it's gone...

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:48.880
What's wrong?

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:51.190
Say, what's wrong?

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.240
Huh? Oh! W... Well... er... Your hat...

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.320
Oh, don't worry about that.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.490
But...

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:06.900
You must've come here to play tennis.
I'm... Oda Kumiko.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:13.020
Won...der...ful...

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.620
What?!
Won...der...ful...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:14.680
By... your... self?
What?!

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:17.490
By... your... self?

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:19.890
Wh... N... No...
By... your... self?

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:19.970
By... your... self?

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:22.130
I'm... traveling alone.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.630
Could you keep me company for today?

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:28.440
What?! Th... That's, er...

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:30.640
Would that be a problem for your friends?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:33.370
Th... That's not it, but...

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:36.110
I know! You must have someone special!

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:38.150
I... I don't have anyone like that.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:43.880
Then, what's the problem? Please... Will you be with me, just for today?

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.690
Th... There was...

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:50.150
...an irresistible yet d... dangerous scent of seduction in the air!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.120
Okay?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:51.980
Uh-huh...
Okay?

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:52.450
I'm glad!
Uh-huh...

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.020
I'm glad!

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:11.000
At that moment... I had no idea that Ayukawa had seen us.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.490
Major scoop! Major scoop!

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:16.720
Hey, hey, did you know?
We saw it! We did!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.660
That dirty bastard Kasuga was with a babe, and then...

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.490
Hey! Are you listening or what?!

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:24.330
Why don't we go tell everybody about it! Well?

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.060
Yeah, that's a good idea!

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.820
You know, I can't stand
men with big mouths!

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.490
Wh... Why can't we tell?
Would it cause a problem?

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:37.700
Do you understand?

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.000
Oh... Gosh...
Do you understand?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:39.040
Do you understand?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:43.000
Oh! I'm a quiet kind of a man, nonchalant and cool...

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.690
She was mysterious and had
an air of dangerous seduction.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:53.210
I was a bit... afraid of her, but...

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.960
...as if there were no bounds...

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:59.650
...my heart was beating faster... as if there were no bounds.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.510
Wanna head over to that mountain?

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:21.940
What? That's impossible!
Wanna head over to that mountain?

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.120
Are you scared?

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.260
That's not it, but...

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:30.160
You're scared! Fact is,
I bet you're thinking that I'm a...

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.390
What?!

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:33.320
Gee... What was that?!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.220
Hey! Wait!

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:49.560
Say, Madoka... Have you seen Darling?!

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:51.310
I wonder...

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:52.570
Have you seen him?!
I wonder...

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:52.650
I wonder...

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.690
H...Huh... O...Oh! No, I don't know where he's at. R...Right, Hatta?

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.310
U...Uh-huh...

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.540
Are you telling the truth?!
U...Uh-huh...

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:01.140
It...It IS the truth!
Are you telling the truth?!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:01.220
It...It IS the truth!

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:04.750
Ooohhh! I can't hold back anymore!
Here I go...

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.730
D... Dumb-ass! If you can't hold it... then go to the bathroom NOW!

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:12.850
Ow! To the bathroom... Here I go!

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.150
Wait!

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:25.170
Wait, I said!

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:42.060
Sorry...

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.890
Go ahead...

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.330
What?!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.710
After thinking about it, I...

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:54.770
"Summer experience:"
euphemism for losing one's virginity.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:09:01.200
...I thought of... having a
"summer experience..." at that moment.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.020
What's wrong?

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.820
The thunder...
What's wrong?

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:14.900
What's wrong?

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:18.200
What's wrong with that?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.340
Well...

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.240
Just what...

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:25.860
Just what kind of personality does she have exactly?!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.070
Inside my head, all was confusion.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.740
But, at this point, I...

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:56.030
...I... er, how should I say it...?

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:06.230
Is that a raindrop I see...?

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.180
...or...

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:32.690
Oh! It's the Thunder Devil!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.910
Oh, Jingoro, come over here!

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:45.880
Oh, my, Jingoro! I didn't know you came along too!

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.030
What?

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:52.220
You didn't listen! I keep telling you he's too heavy to bring along!

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:54.430
Oh, I remember!

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.460
Sorry!

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:01.030
Thunder! I can't stand thunder!

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:04.480
I don't want my bellybutton
to be taken away!

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.430
I wonder what happened to Darling?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.310
Boom! Fried by the thunder...

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.900
Poor Kasuga, chopped in half... I'm afraid it could happen.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:26.350
Hikaru!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:36.440
Hikaru!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.240
Let me go! I've got to... help Darling!

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.180
He'll be back! We just have to wait!

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:40.900
But...

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:41.800
Hikaru!
But...

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.700
Hikaru!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.070
No need to worry about... that fool!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:49.780
I'm sure... that he's found shelter somewhere.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.290
It's too dangerous.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:57.480
If something happens to you, you'll cause everyone a lot of trouble, you know.

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:00.920
Let's go look for him when it's stopped thundering.

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.020
Uh-huh...

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.220
Coward!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.190
What?
Coward!

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:37.070
This sorta thing happens a lot in corny, teenage TV soap-operas...

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:42.440
...but... but how was I to know I was going to experience it in real life?

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.470
I never ever expected that it would happen.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:21.880
What's the matter?

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.340
Weren't you... going to fool around with me?

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:29.320
Why don't you? Tell me!

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.860
I... er...

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:36.730
...well, when it comes right down to it...

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:39.760
...well... I thought that certain things are wrong no matter what.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.130
You're rude...

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:50.100
Look at me...

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.810
Look!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.980
I don't... I'm sorry...

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:07.400
Aren't I... pretty?

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:10.230
Y... You ARE pretty! But...

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:14.100
But what?

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:17.160
What I mean is...

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:22.730
That's not the problem.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.740
What is the problem?

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.250
Awful...

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.520
You're awful!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:36.570
For you... I'm willing to...

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:40.960
I... I don't think that...
j... junior high school students...

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.680
...should be... d... doing...
that kind of thing!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:48.640
You don't have to... tell me that.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.600
Then, what the...?

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:56.440
I wanted to... say something
a little more convincing, but...

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:59.100
...at that moment,
I was awkwardness itself.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:00.870
I thought about it...

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:01.920
Huh?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:04.530
I thought very hard about it...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:08.010
...and then... I made up my mind.

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.160
It doesn't matter!

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.630
W... Wait a sec...

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:39.240
It doesn't matter... what happens to me.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.720
"It d... doesn't matter...?"

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.840
Please...
"It d... doesn't matter...?"

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:43.920
"It d... doesn't matter...?"

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.960
What do you mean by that?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.990
Tell me... Just what's going on?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.010
I'm going to... look for Darling.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.390
I'll go with you.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.500
Oniichan!

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.430
Kasuga!
Oniichan!

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:32.330
Kasuga!

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.500
Kasuga!
Where are you?!
Kasuga!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:33.570
Where are you?!
Kasuga!

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:33.930
Darling!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:34.340
Ka...su...ga!
Where are you?!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:34.940
Darling!
Ka...su...ga!

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:35.570
Oniichan!

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:36.030
Ka...su...ga!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:36.870
Geez! What a troublemaker!

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.000
Darling!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:41.720
Damn! You know, he could be...

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.010
...doing the old "meow-meow" with her!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.650
Here."Meow-meow."

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.240
Geez! What exactly is inside your head?!

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:54.820
As soon as I find that idiot...

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:08.180
Hey, it's useless for all of us to stay together.

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:09.980
Let's split up and look for him.

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:13.060
I'll go look a little further up.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:16.550
Okay, then! Kurumi,
let's go look for him this way.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.620
I'll go over that way with Manami.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:19.210
What?

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:20.840
Yay, yay, yay! Me too!
What?

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:20.920
What?

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:23.260
Wh... Don't you dare try to beat me to it!

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.980
Hikaru, you come with us too!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.930
Wh... Bye-bye!

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:31.360
I'll... look for him downhill...

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.000
I'm... so ashamed.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:44.540
I'm sorry...

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.680
It's dry. Why don't you put it on?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.560
What am I supposed to do... in a situation like this?

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:58.350
I just couldn't think of anything...

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:18.160
I really mean it,
I couldn't think of anything!

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.510
S... Shit!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.920
H... Hi there.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.520
Ayukawa!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.070
Ayukawa!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.770
Ayukawa!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.250
Wait!

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:20.030
Nothing happened... between us!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.650
Nothing...

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:26.640
We only... sheltered ourselves from the rain!

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:29.010
I'm telling you the truth!

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:32.350
It's all my fault...

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:34.580
I'm sorry.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:38.320
I was the one... who led him on.

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:42.370
I was thinking... that I didn't care
what happens to me.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:48.880
In a week, I... will be having an operation...

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.740
...and its success rate is...

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:01.770
...the success rate is...

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:06.000
You're gonna catch a cold.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:14.000
She wasn't "easy" after all.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:32.330
What I saw on her cheek
at that one moment was...

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:35.290
...not a raindrop, after all...

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:39.350
Let's pray for the spirits again next year.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:40.410
Yeah.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:46.900
Go on... in my place...

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:52.760
As she set a lantern afloat... on her own...

00:21:52.760 --> 00:21:56.430
...I knew... I knew that the operation would be successful.

00:21:56.430 --> 00:22:00.150
That's what went through my head at that moment.

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:03.120
So, what happened?

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:08.350
We saw you holding her right here, you know!

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:09.040
What?!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:11.510
Ayukawa saw you too!

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:12.770
A... Ayukawa did?!

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:14.240
Yeah!
A... Ayukawa did?!

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:14.320
A... Ayukawa did?!

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:17.550
We're only keeping quiet 'cause she told us not to tell, you know.

00:22:17.550 --> 00:22:20.020
If she hadn't, well, who knows!
Right, Hatta?

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:22.130
Yeah!

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:25.950
Seems Ayukawa knew about it all along.

00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:36.890
"From Oda Kumiko"

00:22:38.470 --> 00:22:41.010
"How is everything?"

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:48.030
"I am writing from my bed, to tell you that the operation was a success."

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:19.850
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15-years old...

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:23.870
...had one "summer experience."

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:40.420
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:44.670
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:49.010
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.010 --> 00:23:53.250
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.250 --> 00:24:01.120
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:10.630
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:18.440
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:27.110
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:36.820
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.820 --> 00:24:45.200
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.200 --> 00:24:49.540
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.540 --> 00:24:53.870
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.870 --> 00:24:58.180
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.180 --> 00:25:02.520
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.520 --> 00:25:07.340
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:13.050 --> 00:25:16.700
In Ayukawa's eyes, I might only be a kid, but I won't take that for an answer...

00:25:16.700 --> 00:25:20.430
...when she comes back home one morning with a man!

00:25:20.430 --> 00:25:25.430
If that's the case, I might accept
Yukari's invitation... and go all the way!

00:25:25.770 --> 00:25:30.170
Next time: "An Adult Relationship?!
Madoka Secretly Returns Home in the Morning."
